<title>JAPAN: Kanto Gas -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kanto Gas -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  5.04		vs	    4.67</p>
<p> Operating	  917    million	  vs	  773    million</p>
<p> Current		1.22		vs	    1.22</p>
<p> Net		  918    million	  vs	  625    million</p>
<p> EPS		   15.06 yen	  vs	   10.26 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     61 million	  vs	  61 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.50 yen	  vs	    3.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kanto Natural Gas Development Co Ltd produces water-soluble natural gas.</p>
</text>
